From f2bc69a66df06a1405eb856aa8f392c571e4a101 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GrgaPalcic <26028466+GrgaPalcic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:30:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] native cuda: TF_KV_SHARE=n, an adapter over the core pool in
 one prompt_radix store

Ported from upstream 40c03bf13. Kept prompt states are held as the pool's own pages by reference in one radix store, n the number of kept states; off by default. Families opt in; GLM follows in a later patch.
